sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as Operating System
    participant Window as WindowManager
    participant Dispatcher as EventDispatcher
    participant Listeners

    OS->>Window: Hardware Input (e.g., Key Press)
    Window->>Window: Create InputEvent object
    Window->>Dispatcher: dispatchEvent(InputEvent)
    activate Dispatcher
    Dispatcher->>Listeners: notify(InputEvent)
    deactivate Dispatcher
    Listeners->>Listeners: Process Event
